      "importance": 75,
      "importanceReasonZh": "该消息来自 NVIDIA 官方，涉及主流开源模型在权威基准上的性能突破，且强调成本优势，对开发者和企业选型有实际参考价值。",
      "importanceReasonEn": "The news comes from NVIDIA official, highlighting a performance breakthrough of a mainstream open model on an authoritative benchmark, with cost advantages, offering practical reference for developers and enterprises.",
      "scoringMode": "ai",
      "titleZh": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra 在 LangChain Deep Agents 基准测试中取得领先性能",
      "titleEn": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra Achieves Benchmark-Leading Performance with LangChain Deep Agents Harness",
      "summaryZh": "NVIDIA 宣布其 Nemotron 3 Ultra 模型在 LangChain 的 Deep Agents 基准测试中取得领先性能，成为开源模型中准确率最高的，同时以更低的成本完成更多任务，吞吐量更高，运行成本仅为闭源模型的十分之一。",
      "summaryEn": "NVIDIA announced that its Nemotron 3 Ultra model achieved leading performance on LangChain's Deep Agents benchmark, becoming the most accurate open model while completing more tasks at higher throughput and at one-tenth the cost of closed models.",
      "keywords": [
        "NVIDIA",
        "Nemotron 3 Ultra",
        "LangChain",
        "Deep Agents",
        "基准测试",
        "开源模型",
        "成本效益"
      ],
      "topics": [
        "NVIDIA",
